}
```

Let me explore the directory structure more thoroughly to find any related work or data files.

```json
{
  "tool": "run_shell",
  "args": {
    "cmd": "find . -type f -name \"*.md\" -o -name \"*.txt\" -o -name \"*.pdf\" 2>/dev/null | head -50"
  }
}
```

