Let me create the necessary directory structure and implement the numerical solution for the porous medium traveling wave problem.

```json
{
  "tool": "run_shell",
  "args": {
    "cmd": "mkdir code outputs report\\images 2>nul"
  }
}
```

Now let me run the code to generate the results and figures.

```json
{
  "tool": "run_shell",
  "args": {
    "cmd": "cd code && python porous_medium_traveling_wave.py"
  }
}
```

